## 2. Brand Color Tokens (CSS Variables)

Add the following tokens to the **root stylesheet** (e.g. `:root` in `globals.css`, `styles.css`, or your design tokens file). These are the **single source of truth** — do not hardcode hex values anywhere else in the codebase.

```css
:root {
  /* ---------- Brand ---------- */
  --brand-gold: #d9a800;
  --brand-gold-hover: #eecb3a;
  --brand-navy: #1a2a4a;
  --brand-navy-light: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-navy) 90%, transparent);
  --brand-navy-hover: #0a1526;

  /* ---------- Surfaces (dark theme) ---------- */
  --bg: #0a1526;              /* page background */
  --surface: #101d36;          /* cards, panels */
  --surface-2: #16264a;        /* inputs, nested surfaces */
  --surface-3: #1a2a4a;        /* hover state for surfaces */
  --overlay: rgba(10, 21, 38, 0.85); /* modal backdrop */

  /* ---------- Borders & Dividers ---------- */
  --border: rgba(217, 168, 0, 0.18);          /* default border (gold tint) */
  --border-strong: rgba(217, 168, 0, 0.35);   /* focused/active border */
  --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);       /* subtle dividers */

  /* ---------- Typography colors ---------- */
  --text: #eef2f8;             /* primary text */
  --text-dim: #9aa6bd;         /* secondary text, captions, meta */
  --text-muted: #6b7896;       /* placeholder, disabled */
  --text-on-gold: #1a1100;     /* text on gold buttons/badges */

  /* ---------- Semantic / Status ---------- */
  --success: #22c55e;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --danger:  #e23b3b;
  --info:    #3b82f6;

  /* ---------- Effects ---------- */
  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  --shadow-lg: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  --ring: 0 0 0 3px rgba(217, 168, 0, 0.35);  /* focus ring */
}
```

### Color usage map

| Element | Token |
|---|---|
| Page background | `--bg` |
| Cards / panels | `--surface` |
| Input fields, selects, textarea | `--surface-2` |
| Hover on cards/list rows | `--surface-3` |
| Modal backdrop | `--overlay` |
| Primary button / CTA | `--brand-gold` → text `--text-on-gold` |
| Primary button hover | `--brand-gold-hover` |
| Secondary button (outline) | border `--brand-gold`, text `--brand-gold`, hover bg `--brand-gold` |
| Top bar (above nav) | `--brand-navy-hover` |
| Nav bar | `--brand-navy-hover` with border-bottom `--border` |
| Footer | `#06101f` (slightly darker than `--bg`) |
| Links | `--text` default, hover `--brand-gold` |
| Active nav item | `--brand-gold` |
| Headings | `--text` |
| Body text | `--text` |
| Meta / dates / captions | `--text-dim` |
| Placeholder text | `--text-muted` |
| Price tags / accent chips | bg `rgba(217,168,0,0.10)`, text `--brand-gold` |
| Badges (Featured) | bg `--brand-gold`, text `--text-on-gold` |
| Badges (Sold) | bg `--danger`, text `#fff` |
| Focus outline | `--ring` |

