## 3. Typography

### Global font

**Font family:** `"Avenir LT Std 55 Roman"`
**Default body size:** `10pt` (≈ `13.3px`)
**Default line-height:** `1.55`
**Default weight:** `400` (Roman)

### `@font-face` declaration

Place font files under `/public/fonts/` (or your equivalent assets path) and register:

```css
@font-face {
  font-family: "Avenir LT Std";
  src: url("/fonts/AvenirLTStd-Roman.woff2") format("woff2"),
       url("/fonts/AvenirLTStd-Roman.woff")  format("woff");
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "Avenir LT Std";
  src: url("/fonts/AvenirLTStd-Medium.woff2") format("woff2");
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "Avenir LT Std";
  src: url("/fonts/AvenirLTStd-Heavy.woff2") format("woff2");
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
```

### Global font stack

```css
:root {
  --font-sans: "Avenir LT Std 55 Roman", "Avenir LT Std", "Avenir Next",
               "Helvetica Neue", Arial, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-base-size: 10pt;        /* per brand spec */
  --line-height-base: 1.55;
}

html, body {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: var(--font-base-size);
  line-height: var(--line-height-base);
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--bg);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}
```

### Type scale

| Token | Use | Size | Weight | Line-height |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `--text-xs`  | meta, badges       | 11px | 500 | 1.4 |
| `--text-sm`  | secondary body     | 12px | 400 | 1.5 |
| `--text-base`| body (default)     | 10pt (~13px) | 400 | 1.55 |
| `--text-md`  | card titles        | 15px | 600 | 1.4 |
| `--text-lg`  | section heading sm | 18px | 600 | 1.35 |
| `--text-xl`  | page subhead       | 22px | 600 | 1.3 |
| `--text-2xl` | section heading    | 30px | 700 | 1.25 |
| `--text-3xl` | hero secondary     | 36px | 700 | 1.2 |
| `--text-4xl` | hero title         | 44px | 700 | 1.15 |
| `--text-card-excerpt` | card overview / blog excerpt | 14px | 400 | 1.55 |
| `--text-card-chip` | property type badge + price chip on card image | 14px | 700 | 1.2 |

Apply via utility classes or directly to headings:
```css
h1 { font-size: var(--text-4xl); font-weight: 700; }
h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); font-weight: 700; }
h3 { font-size: var(--text-md);  font-weight: 600; }
small, .meta { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--text-dim); }
```

### 3.1 Typography utility prototypes (global)

**Canonical CSS:** `resources/css/app.css` (block comment `Typography utilities`). Use these classes in Vue/Blade instead of hardcoded `font-size` in scoped styles.

| Utility class | Token | Typical use |
|---|---|---|
| `.text-xs` | `--text-xs` | Badges, dates, meta row |
| `.text-sm` | `--text-sm` | Captions, address line, chips |
| `.text-base` | `--text-base` | Default body copy |
| `.text-md` | `--text-md` | Card titles, list headings |
| `.text-lg` | `--text-lg` | Small section titles |
| `.text-xl` | `--text-xl` | Page subheads |
| `.text-2xl` | `--text-2xl` | Section headings |
| `.text-3xl` | `--text-3xl` | Hero secondary line |
| `.text-4xl` | `--text-4xl` | Hero primary title |
| `.text-card-excerpt` | `--text-card-excerpt` | Property overview, blog excerpt |
| `.text-dim` | `--text-dim` | Secondary text color |
| `.text-muted` | `--text-muted` | Placeholder / disabled color |
| `.text-gold` | `--brand-gold` | Accent inline text |
| `.font-medium` | `500` | Labels |
| `.font-semibold` | `600` | Card titles, CTAs |
| `.font-bold` | `700` | Page/section headings |

**Example (property card overview):**
```html
<p class="imas-card__excerpt text-card-excerpt">…</p>
```

**Don'ts:** Do not add new one-off pixel sizes in components; extend `:root` + a utility here if a new tier is needed.

