## 4. Component-Level Requirements

### 4.1 Buttons
- **Primary (gold)**: `background: var(--brand-gold)`, `color: var(--text-on-gold)`, hover `--brand-gold-hover`. Radius `6px`. Padding `12px 22px`. Weight `600`.
- **Outline (gold)**: transparent bg, `1px solid var(--brand-gold)`, text `--brand-gold`. Hover fills with gold.
- **Ghost**: transparent bg, text `--text`. Hover bg `--surface-2`.
- All buttons get focus ring `box-shadow: var(--ring)`.

### 4.2 Inputs / Selects / Textareas
- Background `--surface-2`
- Border `1px solid var(--border)`
- Text color `--text`, placeholder `--text-muted`
- Focus: border `--brand-gold`, `box-shadow: var(--ring)`
- Radius `6px`, padding `12px 14px`

### 4.3 Cards (summary)

All grid/list “teaser” cards share one system. **Canonical implementation:** `resources/css/app.css` (block comment `Global IMas cards`). **Reference components:** `PropertyCard.vue`, `ArticleCard.vue`.

| Token / class | Role |
|---|---|
| `--card-radius` | Outer shell radius (`10px`) |
| `--card-body-padding` | Body padding (`1rem 1.15rem 1.1rem`) |
| `--card-media-ratio` | Default image ratio (`4 / 3`; articles use fixed height) |
| `--chip-bg` | Price/meta chips (`var(--color-accent-soft)`) |
| `.imas-card` | Root wrapper on the card column item |
| `.imas-card__surface` | Painted shell (`background`, `border`, `shadow`) — e.g. `.project-single`, `.news-item` |
| `.imas-card__media` | Image block + optional bottom gradient |
| `.imas-card__body` | Title, excerpt, meta, footer CTA |
| `.imas-card--media-overlay` | Navy gradient on media bottom (price/actions readable) |
| `.imas-card--property` / `.imas-card--article` | Variant hooks for layout-only overrides |

**Shell:** `--surface` bg, **no border** (`border: none`), `--card-radius`, `--shadow-sm`. **Hover** (respect `prefers-reduced-motion`): `translateY(-4px)`, `--shadow-lg`, `--border-strong`. **Media:** `--surface-2`; images `object-fit: cover`.

**Card body (fixes Find Houses white panel):** Find Houses sets `.recently .homes-content` / `.portfolio .homes-content` to `background: #fff !important`. IMas cards **must** override with `background: var(--surface) !important` on `.imas-card .homes-content` / `.imas-card__body` (see `app.css`). Same `--surface` as `.imas-card__surface` so the body is not a white strip.

**Body text:** title `--text-md` / `--font-body` / weight `600` / `--text` / `text-transform: none` (undo theme uppercase); excerpt `--text-card-excerpt` (14px) + `--text-dim`; meta `--text-sm` + `--text-dim`. **Links:** `--text` → hover `--brand-gold`. **Focus** on round media icon buttons: `--ring` only (no extra border).

### 4.15 Global card design (property, blog, teasers)

Use this markup pattern on any new card (testimonials, team, etc.) — keep Find Houses structural classes where the theme requires them, and add IMas BEM hooks:

```html
<!-- Property-style (image overlay + chip + icon actions) -->
<div class="imas-card imas-card--property imas-card--media-overlay …">
  <div class="project-single imas-card__surface">
    <div class="project-head imas-card__media">
      <a class="homes-img">… badges … img …</a>
      <div class="imas-card-actions">
        <div class="imas-chip">…</div>
        <div class="button-effect">
          <button class="btn">…</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="homes-content imas-card__body">
      <h3 class="imas-card__title">…</h3>
      <p class="imas-card__excerpt text-card-excerpt">…</p>
      <p class="imas-card__meta">…</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Blog / article teaser -->
<div class="news-item imas-card imas-card--article …">
  <a class="imas-card__media">…<div class="imas-card__img">…</div></a>
  <div class="news-item-text imas-card__body">
    <h3 class="imas-card__title">…</h3>
    <div class="imas-card__excerpt">…</div>
    <a class="imas-card__cta">Read more…</a>
  </div>
</div>
```

**Badges (on media)**

| Type | Classes | Styles |
|---|---|---|
| Property type (top-left) | `.imas-badge--type` | `property_type.name`, `--text-card-chip` + weight `700` (same size/weight as price amount). Star: `--text`, vertically centered. |
| Sold / negative | `.imas-badge--danger`, `.imas-sold-out-badge` | bg `--danger`, text `--text`, RTL mirror top-inline-end |

**Chips (price, “from $X”)**

- Class `.imas-chip` (property: `.homes-price.imas-start-price`)
- bg `--chip-bg`, text `--brand-gold`, `--text-card-chip`, amount weight `700`, “from” weight `500` (same font-size as type badge)

**Icon actions (video, favorite)**

- **Keep Find Houses shape:** `31×31` circle, `border-radius: 100%`, **no extra border** (do not wrap with gold/outline rings).
- **Recolor only:** btn bg `--surface-2`, icon `--text`; hover btn `--brand-gold`, icon `--text-on-gold`; favorited heart icon `--brand-gold` (hover icon `--text-on-gold` on gold btn).
- Standard theme classes: `.button-effect .btn` inside `.imas-card-actions`; always visible on property cards (override theme slide-in).

**Article-specific**

- `.imas-card--article .imas-card__img` height `220px` (overrides aspect ratio)
- Date/meta: `--brand-gold`, `--text-xs`
- CTA link: `.imas-card__cta`, `--brand-gold`, `--text-sm`, weight `600`

**Do not** duplicate shell colors in Vue `scoped` styles — only layout clamps, RTL badge position, or variant-specific structure.

### 4.4 Navbar / Top bar
- Top bar background `--brand-navy-hover`, text `--text-dim`, icons `--text-dim` → hover `--brand-gold`.
- Main nav background `--brand-navy-hover`, links `--text`, active/hover `--brand-gold`.
- Logo mark: gold border + gold text, transparent bg.

### 4.5 Footer
- Background `#06101f`
- Headings color `#fff` with a 30px gold underline (`::after` 2px gold bar).
- Links `--text-dim`, hover `--brand-gold`.
- Newsletter input background `#0d1a30`, subscribe button `--brand-gold` with `--text-on-gold`.

### 4.6 Tables
- Header row bg `--surface-2`, text `--text`.
- Row hover bg `--surface-3`.
- Borders `--divider`.

### 4.7 Modals / Dialogs
- Backdrop `var(--overlay)`.
- Panel bg `--surface`, border `--border`, radius `10px`, shadow `--shadow-lg`.

### 4.8 Tooltips / Popovers
- Background `--surface-3`, text `--text`, border `--border`, shadow `--shadow-md`.

### 4.9 Toasts / Alerts
- Default: bg `--surface`, border `--border`.
- Success: left-border `--success`.
- Warning: left-border `--warning`.
- Danger: left-border `--danger`.
- Info: left-border `--info`.

### 4.10 Forms
- Labels `--text-dim`, font-weight `500`.
- Helper text `--text-muted`, `--text-xs`.
- Error text `--danger`.

### 4.11 Badges & Chips
- Featured / status (positive): bg `--brand-gold`, text `--text-on-gold`, uppercase, `font-size: 11px`, `letter-spacing: 0.5px`, padding `5px 10px`, radius `4px`.
- Sold / negative: bg `--danger`, text `#fff`.
- Price chip: bg `rgba(217,168,0,0.10)`, text `--brand-gold`.

### 4.12 Pagination
- Default: border `--border`, text `--text-dim`.
- Active / hover: bg `--brand-gold`, text `--text-on-gold`, border `--brand-gold`.

### 4.13 Scrollbars
```css
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--surface-3); border-radius: 6px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--brand-gold); }
```

### 4.14 Text selection
```css
::selection { background: var(--brand-gold); color: var(--text-on-gold); }
```

