## 5. Page-Specific Prototype Reference

Two reference HTML prototypes have been built and should be used as the visual source of truth:

| Page | Reference file |
|---|---|
| Home / Landing | `imas-dark/index.html` |
| Blog listing | `imas-dark/blog.html` |
| Shared styles | `imas-dark/styles.css` |
| Shared JS | `imas-dark/script.js` |

### 5.1 Home page sections (top → bottom)
1. **Top contact bar** — phone, email (left); social icons (right). Bg `--brand-navy-hover`.
2. **Main nav** — logo, links (Home, Buy Real Estate, Turkish Citizenship, Blogs, Pages, Contact Us), language switcher, Sign In.
3. **Hero** — full-bleed cityscape image with `linear-gradient(rgba(10,21,38,.7), rgba(10,21,38,.85))` overlay. Centered headline + subhead. Slider dots below (active dot = gold pill).
4. **Search bar** — overlaps hero by `-40px`, 5 columns: keyword input, property type select, location select, advanced search select, gold "Search Now" button.
5. **Featured Properties** — 3-column grid (2 rows), property cards with image, Featured badge, price chip, title, location.
6. **Why Choose Us** — 3-column feature blocks with circular gold-tinted icon, title, description. Section bg `#06101f`.
7. **Discover Popular Properties** — 4-column grid of property cards.
8. **Client Testimonials** — 3-column quote cards with avatar, name, role, decorative gold quotation mark. Carousel arrows below.
9. **Articles & Tips** — 3-column blog teaser cards with image, title, excerpt, gold "Read more →".
10. **Footer** — 4 columns: brand+contact, Navigation, Useful links, Newsletter. Copyright row at bottom with socials.

### 5.2 Blog listing page
1. Same top bar + nav.
2. **Page header** — full-width banner with dark overlay over image, "BLOG" title, breadcrumb (Home / Blogs) with gold "Blogs".
3. **Two-column layout**:
   - **Main (left)** — 2-column grid of blog post cards (image, title, date + view count in gold/dim, excerpt, "Read more..." gold link).
   - **Sidebar (right, 320px)** — three widgets:
     - **Search** widget (input + gold submit button)
     - **Categories** list with gold "›" markers and dashed dividers
     - **Recent posts** list (thumbnail + title + date)
4. **Pagination** — Previous, 1 (active gold), 2, Next.
5. Same footer.

### 5.3 Responsive breakpoints
- `≥ 901px`: full layout as designed.
- `≤ 900px`: 3-col and 4-col grids collapse to 2 columns. Blog sidebar drops below main content. Nav links hide (replace with hamburger).
- `≤ 560px`: all grids collapse to 1 column. Hero title shrinks to 30px.

