## 7. Don'ts

- **Don't** hardcode hex colors in components — always reference tokens.
- **Don't** use pure black (`#000`) for backgrounds — use `--bg` (`#0a1526`).
- **Don't** use pure white (`#fff`) for body text — use `--text` (`#eef2f8`).
- **Don't** introduce additional accent colors outside the gold/navy palette.
- **Don't** change layout, spacing, or component structure — this is a **theme + typography** change only.
- **Don't** remove existing functionality or routes.

